      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scam or solicitation"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estafa o captación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Au plus %lld plans ouverts à la fois : ce que vous comptez vraiment faire, pas une annonce permanente.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most %lld plans open at a time: what you actually mean to do, not a standing advert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Como máximo %lld planes abiertos a la vez: lo que de verdad piensas hacer, no un anuncio permanente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Au-delà d'une, il faut les plans de groupe — compris à partir de Virée, ou à l'unité avec une « Tablée ».": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beyond one, you need group plans — included from Virée upwards, or singly with a Tablée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Más de una requiere planes de grupo — incluidos a partir de Virée, o por unidades con una Tablée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucun jour retenu : le fil montre tous les jours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No days selected: the feed shows every day."
