    "Bornées à toutes les offres, socle gratuit compris. Elles reviennent à minuit. C'est ce qui empêche d'arroser — sur Weave, une demande vaut quelque chose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capped on every plan, the free tier included. They come back at midnight. That's what stops people spraying requests — on Weave, asking costs you something."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limitadas en todas las suscripciones, incluida la gratuita. Vuelven a medianoche. Es lo que impide lanzar la caña a todo el mundo — en Weave, pedir vale algo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bouger": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get moving"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moverse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C'est le moment de publier quelque chose. Un plan sans réponse reste un plan : vous ferez ce que vous aviez prévu.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now's the time to post something. A plan with no replies is still a plan: you'll do what you were going to do."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
