    "Vos plans ouverts disparaissent du fil immédiatement. Tout le reste est effacé sous %lld jours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your open plans leave the feed straight away. Everything else is deleted within %lld days."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus planes abiertos desaparecen del muro de inmediato. Todo lo demás se borra en un plazo de %lld días."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos plans sortent du fil et personne ne peut plus demander à venir. Rien n'est supprimé : vos conversations vous attendent, et vos plans reviennent à la reprise.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plans leave the feed and no one can ask to come. Nothing is deleted: your conversations wait for you, and your plans come back when you resume."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus planes salen del muro y nadie puede pedir venir. No se borra nada: tus conversaciones te esperan, y tus planes vuelven al reanudar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos plans, vos demandes et vos conversations seront effacés. Cette action ne s'annule pas.\n\nUn abonnement souscrit via l'App Store se résilie séparément, dans les réglages de votre compte Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plans, your requests and your conversations will be erased. This cannot be undone.\n\nA subscription taken out through the App Store is cancelled separately, in your Apple account settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus planes, tus peticiones y tus conversaciones se borrarán. Esto no se puede deshacer.\n\nUna suscripción contratada a través de la App Store se cancela aparte, en los ajustes de tu cuenta de Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre adresse e-mail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your email address"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu dirección de correo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre bilan": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Bilan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu Bilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre fiche": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your profile"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu ficha"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre fil se compose autour de cette ville, et vos plans y sont visibles. Revenir n'est pas remboursé : l'escale a servi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your feed is built around this town, and your plans are visible there. Coming back isn't refunded: the stopover has been used."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu muro se compone en torno a esta ciudad, y tus planes se ven allí. Volver no se reembolsa: la escala ya se ha usado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre fil se composera autour de cette ville pendant sept jours, et vos plans y seront visibles. Cela consomme une « Escale ».": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your feed will be built around this town for seven days, and your plans will be visible there. This uses one Escale."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu muro se compondrá en torno a esta ciudad durante siete días, y tus planes serán visibles allí. Esto consume una Escale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre offre actuelle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your current plan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu suscripción actual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre offre retient les paliers de 10, 25, 50 et 100 km : le fil s'arrête à %lld km. Votre réglage est conservé et redevient exact avec « critères précis ». Les critères filtrent ce que vous voyez ; ils ne changent jamais l'ordre.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan uses steps of 10, 25, 50 and 100 km: the feed stops at %lld km. Your setting is kept, and becomes exact again with “precise filters”. Filters change what you see; they never change the order."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu suscripción usa tramos de 10, 25, 50 y 100 km: el muro se detiene en %lld km. Tu ajuste se conserva y vuelve a ser exacto con «criterios precisos». Los criterios filtran lo que ves; nunca cambian el orden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre photo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your photo"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu foto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre prénom": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first name"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu nombre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre session a expiré. Reconnectez-vous.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your session has expired. Please sign in again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu sesión ha caducado. Vuelve a iniciar sesión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tú"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous avez déjà accordé %lld places : les reprendre reviendrait à décommander quelqu'un.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've already given out %lld spots: taking them back would mean cancelling on someone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya has concedido %lld plazas: retirarlas sería dejar plantado a alguien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous avez déjà accordé une place : la reprendre reviendrait à décommander quelqu'un.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've already given out a spot: taking it back would mean cancelling on someone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya has concedido una plaza: retirarla sería dejar plantado a alguien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous avez déjà demandé à venir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've already asked to come."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya has pedido venir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous avez déjà demandé à venir. On ne redemande pas deux fois.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've already asked to come. You don't ask twice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya has pedido venir. No se pide dos veces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous en avez %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %lld"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tienes %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous en avez %lld en réserve aujourd'hui.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %lld left for today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te quedan %lld para hoy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous n'avez bloqué personne.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You haven't blocked anyone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No has bloqueado a nadie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous ne verrez plus ses plans, et il ne verra plus les vôtres. Votre conversation se ferme et les demandes en attente entre vous expirent.\n\n%@ n'en est pas informé.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You won't see their plans any more, and they won't see yours. Your conversation closes and any pending requests between you expire.\n\n%@ isn't told."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejarás de ver sus planes, y esa persona dejará de ver los tuyos. Vuestra conversación se cierra y las peticiones pendientes entre vosotros caducan.\n\nNo se le avisa a %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous êtes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous êtes en pause. Vos plans sont retirés du fil et personne ne peut vous écrire de demande. Reprendre les remet tels quels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're paused. Your plans are off the feed and no one can send you a request. Resuming puts them back as they were."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás en pausa. Tus planes están fuera del muro y nadie puede enviarte peticiones. Al reanudar vuelven tal como estaban."
          }
        }
      }
    },
